<title>UK: BankAmerica appoints new European syndicate head.</title>
<headline>BankAmerica appoints new European syndicate head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>BankAmerica has appointed David Chandler as head of its syndication activities in Europe, Middle East and Africa, it said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Chandler will report to Stephen Fleming, senior vice president, Structured Finance.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
